{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAIN-TO-WIN is a top-down horror-shooter set in a dystopian prison-world that will never happen. You play as an organ extractor, earning money by bounty hunting madmen, psychos, and other violent degenerates. Inspired by PSX-era maniac aesthetics like LOADED and THRILL KILL, mixed with the top-down gore and mayhem of modern Miami-like games.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.poster.avif?t=1764365023\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.webm?t=1764365023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.mp4?t=1764365023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaotic Mess of Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive and brutal gunfights with destructible level environments create chaotic combat, bloodshed, and gore \u2014 each encounter can leave the map twisted and ruined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Megaprison Freaks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Megaprison and meet its psycho inmates \u2014 violent brain-surgery addicts, broken minds, and body-mod fanatics. They\u2019ll trade organs, share deranged stories, offer side quests\u2026 or try to kill you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World of Pain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy perks and upgrades to survive a little longer and crawl deeper inside a world fueled by hate, torture, and crude surgery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deadly Maze of Madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted, highly detailed non-pixel art levels \u2014 packed with dangers, secrets, and mobs of deranged enemies \u2014 connect through a shifting maze with rogue-lite elements, making every run feel a little different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/7ab52dcf020ff1a8e704c3f463413432.poster.avif?t=1764365023\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/7ab52dcf020ff1a8e704c3f463413432.webm?t=1764365023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/7ab52dcf020ff1a8e704c3f463413432.mp4?t=1764365023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/727690?t=1764365023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764365023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/2d1de65a0f2213d0f9824de6eafe339ef5a187bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764365023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/2d1de65a0f2213d0f9824de6eafe339ef5a187bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764365023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Gore, Violence"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2355300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAIN-TO-WIN is a top-down horror-shooter set in a dystopian prison-world that will never happen. You play as an organ extractor, earning money by bounty hunting madmen, psychos, and other violent de